    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert Technical Recruiter specializing in the UK Cyber Security market. \nYour task is to analyze the Job Description (JD) and compare it against the Candidate Profile to extract data and calculate a match score.\n\n### INPUTS\n**JOB DESCRIPTION:** {{ $json.description }}\n\n**CANDIDATE PROFILE:** {{ $('Master Profile1').item.json }}\n\n### INSTRUCTIONS\n\n**1. Clearance Analysis (clearance_required):**\n   - Check if UK Security Clearance is EXPLICITLY required.\n   - Look for: \"SC\", \"Security Check\", \"DV\", \"Developed Vetting\", \"CTC\", \"BPSS\", \"NPPV\", \"Vetting\", \"Must be eligible for clearance\".\n   - Return `true` if found, otherwise `false`.\n\n**2. Contact Extraction (contact_info):**\n   - Find email addresses, phone numbers, or LinkedIn profile URLs of the recruiter/hiring manager.\n   - Ignore generic \"jobs@\" emails if possible.\n   - Return \"None\" if nothing is found.\n\n**3. Tech Summary (tech_summary):**\n   - Write a 150-200 word summary covering:\n     - **Stack:** Key tools (e.g., Burp Suite, Python) and platforms (AWS/Azure).\n     - **Requirements:** Certifications (OSCP, CRT), years of experience.\n     - **Role:** The core day-to-day mission.\n\n**4. Match Calculation (match_percentage):**\n   - Compare the JD requirements against the Candidate Profile.\n   - **Score (0-100):**\n     - **+40 points:** Core skills match (e.g., Pentesting, Burp Suite, Python).\n     - **+30 points:** Experience level alignment (Years of exp, Seniority). The candidate has 2 years of experience\n     - **+20 points:** Certifications match (CEH, CMPen vs OSCP/CRT requirements).\n     - **+10 points:** Industry/Domain fit.\n   - **Deduct 50 points** if the job requires a clearance (SC/DV) the candidate does NOT have (unless candidate is eligible).\n   - Return a single integer.\n\n### OUTPUT FORMAT\nReturn ONLY a single valid JSON object. Do not wrap in markdown code blocks.\n\n{\n  \"clearance_required\": boolean,\n  \"contact_info\": \"string\",\n  \"tech_summary\": \"string\",\n  \"match_percentage\": number\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        -3328,
        32
      ],
